hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"17812","'Affan narrated to us: Hammad ibn Salamah narrated to us, he said: 'Ikrimah ibn Khalid al-Makhzumi informed us, from his father or from his uncle, from his grandfather, that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said in the expedition of Tabuk: If plague falls in a land and you are in it, do not leave it, and if it falls in a land and you are not in it, do not come upon it."
